    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "One thing I miss from old Twitter is getting incredible backlash for saying the most normal things. \ud83d\ude02",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2052902140582957546",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-09T00:03:06+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "New Real Talk with Zuby podcast with @thatsKAIZEN out today!\n\npiped.video/iJ8VuJqAHHg?si=m0ac\u2026",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2052824778197655636",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-08T18:55:41+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Marriage rates are going to keep dropping in the West. I don't see them reversing anytime soon.\n\nPeople can't even agree on what 'marriage' means anymore. There are all these different interpretations, expectations, and permutations.\n\nIt's deranging. Tough sell for many.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2052801653795860693",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-08T17:23:48+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I'm amused by this idea that prior to 'capitalism', people didn't have to work to survive.\n\n\nS.\ud83c\udfa7 (@1ssve)\n\nCapitalism makes quitting your job feel like risking your life, because it ties your basic survival needs to staying employed. This system is predatory.\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/1ssve/status/2052040328048505307#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2052759782025478336",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-08T14:37:25+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The incidence of pronouns in social media bios and email signatures is down at least 70% since the peak in 2020.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2052095258209517643",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-06T18:36:50+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I've lived in the Middle East for 20+ years and in the West for 20+ years and I'm not 40 yet.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2052556815305412743",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-08T01:10:54+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Writing a book is a hard work.\n\nA workout for the brain that takes months or years.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2052481407092396146",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-07T20:11:15+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Imagine living in a society that spares the innocent and punishes the guilty, rather than the opposite.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2052080122098786478",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-06T17:36:41+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Something something 'fair share'. \ud83d\ude43\n\n\nElon Musk (@elonmusk)\n\nI have paid over $10B in taxes in a single year, more than anyone in history. \n\nIf I exercise and sell stock options, the combined federal and state income tax is ~45% (I still pay California taxes for every day I spend there). \n\nThen there is another 40% tax paid on my estate when I die.\n\nOverall, I will probably end up paying trillions in taxes.\n\n\n\n\u2014 https://nitter.net/elonmusk/status/2052126760633040977#m",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2052163553147134039",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-06T23:08:13+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "zuby",
      "voiceName": "Zuby",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Going to the gym won't solve all of your problems but it's a good start.",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ZubyMusic/status/2052007632513241554",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-06T12:48:38+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
